{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1186","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Vus the Cossack and a Contest"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vus the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cossacks"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Cossack"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" holds a programming competition, in which $$$n$$$ people participate. He decided to award them all with pens and notebooks. It is known that Vus has exactly $$$m$$$ pens and $$$k$$$ notebooks."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Determine whether the Cossack can reward "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"all"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" participants, giving each of them at least one pen and at least one notebook."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$m$$$, and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n, m, k \\leq 100$$$) — the number of participants, the number of pens, and the number of notebooks respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if it possible to reward all the participants. Otherwise, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can print each letter in any case (upper or lower)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 8 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 9 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8 5 20\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNo\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, there are $$$5$$$ participants. The Cossack has $$$8$$$ pens and $$$6$$$ notebooks. Therefore, he has enough pens and notebooks."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, there are $$$3$$$ participants. The Cossack has $$$9$$$ pens and $$$3$$$ notebooks. He has more than enough pens but only the minimum needed number of notebooks."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, there are $$$8$$$ participants but only $$$5$$$ pens. Since the Cossack does not have enough pens, the answer is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1186A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1186/problem/A"}